# This repo tracks the website (frontend-web/) and the active Flutter mobile
# app (mobile_flutter/). Everything else at the root (docs, PDFs, reference
# images, corpus data) is workspace scratch material and stays untracked.
#
# mobile/ is the abandoned Expo attempt. It is kept on disk for one file,
# mobile/migration-progress.md, and is deliberately NOT un-ignored here: it was
# never going to be committed, and un-ignoring it only made git list its 58
# files as untracked in every status and every editor sidebar, forever.
/*
!/frontend-web/
!/mobile_flutter/
!/backend/
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
